export const normalizeVendor=s=>String(s||'').toLowerCase().replace(/&/g,'and').replace(/\b(incorporated|inc|llc|limited|ltd|company|co|corp|corporation)\b/g,'').replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'');
export function similarSupplier(a,b){const x=normalizeVendor(a),y=normalizeVendor(b);if(Math.min(x.length,y.length)<8||Math.abs(x.length-y.length)>1)return false;let previous=Array.from({length:y.length+1},(_,i)=>i);for(let i=1;i<=x.length;i++){const row=[i];for(let j=1;j<=y.length;j++)row[j]=Math.min(row[j-1]+1,previous[j]+1,previous[j-1]+(x[i-1]===y[j-1]?0:1));previous=row;}return previous[y.length]===1;}
export const supplierReviewKey=(i,p)=>JSON.stringify([i.vendor,p.vendor,i.number,p.number]);
export function confirmSupplier(invoice,po,note){if(!similarSupplier(invoice.vendor,po.vendor))throw Error('Supplier names are not a supported typo candidate. Correct the source or select the right supplier.');if(!note?.trim())throw Error('Record how you verified the supplier identity.');return {...invoice,supplierReview:{key:supplierReviewKey(invoice,po),note:note.trim(),confirmedAt:new Date().toISOString()}};}
export function supplierEvidence(i,p){const x=normalizeVendor(i.vendor),y=normalizeVendor(p.vendor);if(x&&x===y)return i.vendor.trim().toLowerCase()===p.vendor.trim().toLowerCase()?'Supplier names match.':'Supplier names match after punctuation and company-suffix normalization; verify legal identity during review.';if(similarSupplier(i.vendor,p.vendor)){if(i.supplierReview?.key===supplierReviewKey(i,p)&&i.supplierReview.note?.trim())return 'Supplier spelling variation confirmed by reviewer: '+i.supplierReview.note;const e=Error('Similar supplier names require identity review. Verify supplier records before comparing these documents.');e.code='SUPPLIER_REVIEW';throw e;}throw Error('Vendor mismatch. Select documents from the same vendor.');}
